            "content": {
                "title_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "The CEO's Guide to Physical AI"
                    }
                ],
                "level": 1
            },
            "bbox": [
                40,
                476,
                654,
                579
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "ARTICLE MAY 12, 2026 5 MIN READ"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                40,
                601,
                351,
                620
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "title",
            "content": {
                "title_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "What's at Stake"
                    }
                ],
                "level": 2
            },
            "bbox": [
                40,
                681,
                425,
                720
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "CEOs who’ve never considered automation—or have yet to act on it—may be underestimating how much has changed in recent years. Thanks to advances in physical AI, robotics is entering a new era, expanding what can be automated across industries and supply chains. Robots can now see, adapt, and adjust in real time, reducing deployment costs and complexity, accelerating adoption, and raising the cost of standing still for companies that hesitate."
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                38,
                747,
                946,
                850
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "title",
            "content": {
                "title_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "What the Numbers Say"
                    }
                ],
                "level": 2
            },
            "bbox": [
                40,
                863,
                622,
                904
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "page_footer",
            "content": {
                "page_footer_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
