        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "Physical AI has advanced significantly in recent years, and that momentum is likely to continue. CEOs who make smart choices now about where and when to deploy it, and do so responsibly, will not only be better positioned to unlock new levels of efficiency and value. They will also build scale and know-how that slower competitors will struggle to match."
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                40,
                67,
                954,
                146
            ]
        },
